# PR screenshots, video, and evidence

For **user-visible or UI feature work** (Field Eng slotcraft demo), evidence in the PR is **required**, not optional. Cloud agents, Jira “Use Cursor”, and automations must follow this.

## Capture and commit

- Include a **short demo video** (`.webm` / `.mp4`) and/or **screenshots** (`.png`, etc.) in the PR body proving the change works.
- **Commit** media on the PR head branch, e.g. under `.github/evidence/<ticket-or-slug>/` (use the Jira key or a short slug).

## Embed in the PR body

When embedding images or video in pull request bodies (including automation-generated PRs):

- **Do not** use relative paths such as `.github/evidence/...` or repo-relative file paths — they break for reviewers and tools.
- **Do** use **absolute** raw GitHub URLs only:

  `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/christineywang/slotcraft/<branch>/path/to/file.png`

  (Same pattern for `.webm`, `.mp4`, etc.)

Replace `<branch>` with the PR’s head branch name.

Example markdown:

```markdown
![Booking conflict UI](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/christineywang/slotcraft/cursor/my-feature-10a9/.github/evidence/CHR-123/conflict-409.png)
```

## When evidence cannot be captured

State that explicitly in the PR (e.g. under **Evidence** or **Testing**) with a **reason** — do not silently omit evidence.
